# UPLINK SecretVM secrets - paste as Encrypted Secrets (or fill the form
# SecretVM auto-builds from the six environment substitutions).
#
# Replace every YOUR_* / PASTE_* value. Generate the seed with:
#   openssl rand -hex 32
#
# ---- 1. Minimum to run (six operator fillables; form stays six) ----
WALLET_PRIVATE_KEY=0xYOUR_PRIVATE_KEY
ETH_NODE_ADDRESS=https://base-mainnet.g.alchemy.com/v2/YOUR_ALCHEMY_KEY
COOKIE_CONTENT=admin:YOUR_STRONG_PASSWORD
ADMIN_PASSWORD=YOUR_GUI_PASSWORD
API_KEY_SEED=PASTE_openssl_rand_hex_32_HERE
WEB_PUBLIC_URL=https://your-vm-name.vm.scrtlabs.com
#
# Tunables change via compose/code only -- NOT Encrypted Secrets.
#
# ---- 2. Uplink tunable / additional (Uplink process only; uplink_bake_env) ----
#   ACTIVE_MODELS_URL=https://active.mor.org/gateway_models.json
#   GATEWAY_BIDS_URL=https://active.mor.org/gateway_bids.json
#   SESSION_DURATION_SECONDS=600
#   SESSION_FAILOVER=true
#   HOUSEKEEPING=true
# Image/wiring defaults (also Uplink process, not form knobs):
#   UPLINK_LISTEN, ROUTER_URL, DATA_DIR, USAGE_PRUNE_DAYS,
#   SESSION_DIRECT_PAYMENT, CLOSE_SESSIONS_ON_EXIT
# Note: Diamond / ETH_NODE_CHAIN_ID may exist in Uplink config defaults but
# are NOT operator knobs -- do not list them as Uplink tunables.
#
# ---- 3. Router tunable / additional (proxy-router only; router_network_env) ----
# Process env wins over godotenv-loaded file.
#   PROXY_STORE_CHAT_CONTEXT, PROXY_FORWARD_CHAT_CONTEXT
#   LOG_LEVEL_APP, LOG_LEVEL_TCP, LOG_LEVEL_ETH_RPC
#   ETH_NODE_CHAIN_ID, ETH_NODE_USE_SUBSCRIPTIONS, BLOCKSCOUT_API_URL
#   DIAMOND_CONTRACT_ADDRESS, MOR_TOKEN_ADDRESS
# NEVER put router PROXY_* / LOG_LEVEL_* into uplink bake or Encrypted Secrets.
